<tr><td>"Under Review" status / missing "Closed"</td><td>FRS confirmed authoritative: Under Review is a display group, not a real status; Closed is a real status separate from Resolved. Frontend needs fixing to match.</td></tr>
<tr class="alt"><td>Ethiopia-only vs. multi-country platform</td><td>Confirmed: Ethiopia-scoped for now, per FRS. The multi-country architecture docs are a possible future direction, not current scope.</td></tr>
</table>

